From 45b88dc2b250271422db1e3c547eecb3ad5514d5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 15:46:52 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] docs(process): remove the unused ci.yml and nightly.yml
 workflows

Delete the two manual-only workflows (workflow_dispatch trigger; ci.yml last ran 2026-11-06, nightly.yml has no run in the last 100). Every gate tier runs locally with cargo xtask gate; GitHub runs only release.yml on a pushed tag. AGENTS.md, README.md, scripts/README.md and the site gates page no longer name them. PROCESS_VERSION 54 -> 55. Decision recorded in docs/decisions/1415-remove-dead-workflows.md. Files and text only: nothing built or run.

Fixes #1415
Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
